<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank sets next repos at unchanged 3.00 pct.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank sets next repos at unchanged 3.00 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said on Thursday that it would set its next two securities repurchase tenders at an unchanged fixed rate of three percent.</p>
<p>It cut its repo rate to three percent from 3.30 percent two weeks ago.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
